  "idea": "Linear vs Jira: why modern engineering teams are ditching Atlassian",
  "text": "Is Linear really worth migrating your entire engineering organization off Jira? Enterprise leaders fear losing custom audit logs and executive reports by leaving the Atlassian ecosystem. However, Jira's slow interface breeds stale ticket backlogs and inaccurate sprint forecasts that constantly mislead leadership. Linear delivers automated project roadmap rollups for executives while giving developers instant keyboard-driven ticket management. This alignment accelerates software release cycles dramatically.",
